1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,940
But there's one message you can tell a youth from our life.

2
00:00:06,020 --> 00:00:07,060
How you think creates how you feel.

3
00:00:07,240 --> 00:00:08,360
How you feel becomes an emotion.

4
00:00:08,620 --> 00:00:10,020
That emotion becomes a vibration.

5
00:00:10,320 --> 00:00:14,600
That vibration becomes a magnet that attracts things to you, also repels things away from you.

6
00:00:14,840 --> 00:00:16,080
Only think about what you want.

7
00:00:16,300 --> 00:00:17,400
Forget about what you don't want.

8
00:00:17,480 --> 00:00:18,740
Never speak about what you don't have.

9
00:00:18,820 --> 00:00:25,060
If there's no enemy on the inside of your mind, no enemy on the outside could ever do you or your body any harm.

10
00:00:25,280 --> 00:00:26,460
Don't look out the window.

11
00:00:26,680 --> 00:00:27,280
Look in the mirror.

12
00:00:27,680 --> 00:00:28,520
Fuck what they say.

13
00:00:28,800 --> 00:00:29,600
Fuck how they feel.

14
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:35,240
Do you do what you want to do and be good at it? Just make sure what you do is good to you and for you